{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "53e34093-52b7-8a02-9f5b-a4fff8e90bef",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:38:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hi? I'm calling about a streetlight pole? It's leaning now? Somebody's car hit it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Got it. A pole that's been hit by a car. Where is this, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of my house? 443 Bridge Street? Down the Point?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "443 Bridge Street. Okay, I'm writing that down. When did the car hit it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think Sunday night? I heard a bang? And in the morning the pole was tipped over a little? Like it's tired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tipped over a little. Is the light still working, or is it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's still on? But it flickers? And I don't like it, honestly? It's been three days and nobody has come? [pause] Hold on, there's a crackle on my line, can you hear that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear a little bit of something, yeah. Faint."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It gets louder when I move? See, listen? I'm walking to the window? [line breaks up] Is that better or worse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little worse, actually. Maybe stay put by the phone and we'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sitting down? So can you send somebody to check the pole? Before it falls on somebody's car? Or on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a request for a crew to go look at it. Leaning pole, hit by a vehicle, flickering light, 443 Bridge Street. Anything else about it? Wires hanging, sparks, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires down? I looked? But it's leaning toward the street? Not the house, thank goodness?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Toward the street, no wires down. If you ever see wires on the ground or sparks, stay back and call 911 right away, okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I know? But I shouldn't have to wait three days for somebody to look at a pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:37:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll mark it so they look at it as soon as they can. Can I get a callback number in case the crew wants to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:38:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0176? That's the landline? With the crackle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0176. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniela Ortiz? O-R-T-I-Z?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Ortiz. Request is in. Somebody should be out to look at it in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days? Well, okay? Thank you? Goodbye?"
    }
  ],
